00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:03.110 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  a few days ago the twitter channel of  the witcher hosted the first footage of  the second season you can see richard in  a new armor which is much darker  and has new shoulder armor shortly after  there were also snapshots of siri who  can be seen in front of a snowy  background  and with a wooden sword the caption says  looks like someone has spent time with  the witcher  this is of course an allusion to the  fact that syria and gerald will travel  to karamorin in the coming season  analogous to the first volume of the  witcher book series  siri will start her training as a  witcher there which explains the new  outfit  and training sword the release date of  the second the witcher season is not  known for sure but is planned to be  released  in 2021 as constantine film announced  this week a resident evil film reboot is  currently in the works  in terms of content it will be strongly  oriented towards the first video games  of the series  as horror film director johannes roberts  explains they want to reproduce  exactly the experience that many people  had when playing the first two parts  at the same time the plan is also to  pack the whole thing into a down to  earth story about a small  almost extinct town nevertheless the  spencer estate in raccoon city from 1998  will be the center of attention  especially fans of the video game should  be pleased  since none of the films that have been  released so far have really picked up on  this terrifying mansion at the same time  most of the cast has been revealed so  caius scalda oreo  will appear as claire redfield hannah  john cayman as  jill valentine and robbie mel as chris  redfield also included are tom hopper as  albert wesker avon jojia as leon kennedy  and neil madonna  as william burking unfortunately there  is no start date for this reboot yet but  we will keep you informed about any  future news  a godzilla anime series is currently in  development for netflix  although not much is known about the  actual plot yet at least the signing of  the award-winning japanese sci-fi author  toedjo could be announced  for the visual design two well-known  designers were hired  namely blue exorcists creator kazu katu  and ijayamimori who had already worked  on spirited away after the godzilla  anime films planet of the monsters  and the planet eater we are definitely  looking forward to the series  the series will be called godzilla  singular point and is planned to be  released on netflix  over the course of next year the fact  that dune is postponed  should actually not surprise anyone  anymore the new start date has now been  moved by 10 months to october 1st  2021. as with many other movies before  this caused a chain reaction  also affected is the batman which is now  scheduled on march 4th  2022. the flash has been moved to  november 4th 2022  while shazam 2 will now be released on  june 2nd  2023 jurassic world domination will also  not get off scot-free and will now have  to be content with the u.s state  on june 11 2022. one film however  will be moved to the front namely matrix  iv  the blockbuster with keanu reeves is now  scheduled to be released  on december 23rd 2021 instead of april  2022 dc's superhero movie black adam  hits probably the hardest as this one is  now even postponed  indefinitely the one who was also  heavily affected is the world's second  largest cinema chain cineworld because  after many setbacks in recent months  they have decided to temporarily close  all cinemas in great britain and ireland  we can only hope that the small  and medium-sized cinema operators in  particular don't have to close their  doors forever as the hollywood reporter  exclusively revealed a few days ago  jamie foxx will probably return  as villain electro in marvel's  spider-man 3.  yes you heard it right the electro who  appeared in the amazing spider-man 2  with andrew garfield as spider-man  apparently the negotiations with jamie  foxx  are already close to completion which  means that electro  is a character from a completely  different film universe  this again could be an indication that  sony after many years of unsuccessful  attempts  will finally create its own cinema  universe around the friendly spider from  your neighborhood the agreement between  sony and marvel provides that tom  holland spider-man  may stay in the mcu for three solo films  but then  returns to sony since the first two  films homecoming and far from home have  already been revealed the contract is  fulfilled after spider-man 3. the hype  around spider-man  is at its peak at the moment due to tom  holland which is why sony could now make  a new attempt towards its own film  universe  there are still enough characters with  venom morbius silk  and madame web in any case some fans  even think that this  points towards a greater reunion with  tom holland andrew garfield and toby  maguire of course  this is all speculation and marvel  hasn't officially commented on it yet  however before the time could come this  still nameless  spider-man 3 is expected to be released  on december 17  [Music]  2021  bye

